---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Terms of Service — PintDownload" description="Terms of Service for PintDownload Pinterest Downloader.">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto py-8 text-left bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-3xl p-8 sm:p-12 shadow-sm">
    <h1 class="font-display text-4xl sm:text-5xl text-slate-900 mb-4">Terms of Service</h1>
    <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mb-6">Last updated: July 23, 2026</p>
    
    <div class="prose max-w-none text-slate-700 text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed space-y-4 font-medium">
      <p>By accessing or using PintDownload (https://pintdownload.app), you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service.</p>
      
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mt-6 mb-2">1. Permitted Use</h2>
      <p>PintDownload provides media extraction tools for public Pinterest pins. Users agree to use PintDownload strictly for lawful, personal, non-commercial, or authorized content archiving purposes.</p>
      
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mt-6 mb-2">2. Copyright and Intellectual Property</h2>
      <p>PintDownload does not own, host, or claim copyright over any media files downloaded through our tool. All intellectual property, trademarks, and media assets belong to their respective original creators and platform rights holders.</p>
      
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mt-6 mb-2">3. Limitation of Liability</h2>
      <p>PintDownload is provided on an "as is" and "as available" basis without warranties of any kind. PintDownload shall not be liable for any damages resulting from improper content usage or copyright violations committed by users.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
